<title>JAPAN: Reuters average July Tapis assessed at $19.03.</title>
<headline>Reuters average July Tapis assessed at $19.03.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average Reuters price for Malaysian Tapis for July was $19.03.</p>
<p>Malaysia's Petronas uses Reuters morning quotes in its monthly term crude formula. Reuters prices:</p>
<p>	  July 1  $19.30  11  $18.90  23  $18.95</p>
<p>		 2  $19.15  14  $18.90  24  $18.95</p>
<p>		 3  $19.15  15  $18.90  25  $18.95</p>
<p>		 4  $19.05  16  $18.50  28  $19.15</p>
<p>		 7  $18.85  17  $19.05  29  $19.25</p>
<p>		 8  $18.85  18  $19.05  30  $19.25</p>
<p>		 9  $18.95  21  $19.20  31  $19.35</p>
<p>		10  $18.90  22  $19.05</p>
